# @Armapunk2035 client mod build output. workshop_item.vdf / workshop_preview.png under here are
# deliberately tracked (they are the publish kit, not build product) and stay tracked regardless.
radio/dist/

# Third-party art vendored into radio/addon/<prefix>/ is NOT committed: ~164 MB of .paa/.p3d that
# git cannot delta-compress and that belongs to outside creators. radio/addon/PROVENANCE.md records
# the upstream source and permission status for each tree. Configs, model.cfg and PROVENANCE.md ARE
# committed, so the build wiring survives a clone even though the binaries must be re-obtained.
radio/addon/**/*.paa
radio/addon/**/*.p3d
radio/addon/**/*.p3d.mlod
radio/addon/**/*.ogv
radio/addon/**/*.rvmat
radio/addon/**/*.rtm
!radio/addon/ap_anims/anims/*.rtm
radio/addon/**/*.jpg
radio/addon/**/*.png
radio/addon/**/texHeaders.bin
scratchpad/skyscraper/node_modules/
scratchpad/skyscraper/tower_dump*.json
scratchpad/skyscraper/tower_patched.mjs
scratchpad/skyscraper/*.p3d
scratchpad/skyscraper/package*.json
textures_png/a3/
scratchpad/skyscraper/*_dump.json
scratchpad/skyscraper/*_patched.mjs
scratchpad/skyscraper/*dump*.json

